&lt;p&gt;Everlaw is looking for a detail-oriented, highly organized &lt;strong&gt;Administrative Coordinator &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team for a 4-6 month temporary assignment. In this role, you will provide critical operational and administrative support, managing calendar coordination, travel logistics, expense documentation, and executing funneled administrative tasks delegated to you. This entry-level position is ideal for an adaptable, high-execution professional who excels at following clear directions, navigating fast-paced environments, and utilizing modern productivity tools like Google Workspace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be embedded within our Office of the CEO team, partnering directly and daily with a seasoned Executive Administrator. The team focuses on streamlining executive logistics, managing complex calendar and travel demands, optimizing workflows, and ensuring smooth, efficient day-to-day operations for our leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, non-exempt position based in our Oakland, CA office with a hybrid work schedule: in office M/W/Th with the option to work from home on Tu/Fr.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Getting started&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We want you to feel like part of the team early on! Our onboarding process will integrate you into the company with informative sessions on our product, policies, processes, and team structure and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re excited for you to learn, grow, and contribute right away! We trust that you’ll bring experience and knowledge that will uplift and uplevel the team, but we don’t expect you to know everything on Day 1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In your role, you&#39;ll...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and manage complex calendars delegated by the Executive Administrative Specialist, proactively resolving scheduling conflicts with precise attention to time zones and meeting links.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle end-to-end meeting logistics, including room bookings, AV preparation, and issuing error-free calendar invites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct initial research for flight, hotel, and ground transportation options through systems like Navan, compiling detailed travel itineraries for approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage expense workflows by collecting digital and physical receipts, organizing documentation, and submitting accurate expense reports through company systems like Rippling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with the Executive Administrative Specialist to execute funneled administrative tasks, ensuring seamless handoffs, accurate execution, and consistent follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice transparent escalation and reporting by communicating progress clearly and flagging operational blockers immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high discretion and professional integrity when handling sensitive data, executive communications, and strategic information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an entry-level professional with prior experience or demonstrated skill in an administrative, coordination, or operational support capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient with Google Workspace (Gmail, Google Calendar, Docs, Sheets, Slides) and comfortable utilizing tools like Zoom and learning new tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are exceptionally detail-oriented with a proven track record of accuracy in calendar management, time zones, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proven to thrive in fast-paced environments, managing competing priorities with composure under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are receptive to direct feedback, applying real-time coaching efficiently to adjust workflows without requiring repeated instruction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a proactive, transparent communicator who flags blockers immediately and pivots quickly when business priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are authorized to work in the United States without restrictions. Please note that at this time, Everlaw is not sponsoring employment visas for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The expected hourly rate range for this role is between $43.27 and $54.81. The final offered hourly rate will be dependent upon many factors including the candidate’s experience and skills. The role&#39;s compensation is subject to change in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be eligible for a number of our benefits, including health, dental, and vision plans and paid company/federal holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Perks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in Uptown Oakland, just steps from the BART line and dozens of restaurants and walking distance to Lake Merritt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work-from-home days on Tuesdays and Fridays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly home internet reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select your preference of hardware (Mac or PC) and customize your desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a wide variety of snacks and beverages in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bond over company-wide out-of-the-box events and fun activities with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off for company-sponsored volunteer events and 4 paid hours per quarter to volunteer at a charitable organization of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take advantage of learning and career development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ranked #9 on Glassdoor&#39;s Best Places to Work 2023 for US small and medium companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One of Wealthfront’s 2021 Career Launching Companies, and ranked #2 on the “2022 Bay Area Best Places to Work” list by the San Francisco Business Times and the Silicon Valley Business Journal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One of Fast Company’s World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies for 2022 and proud contributor of free ediscovery resources to benefit the greater good through “Everlaw for Good”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0,0&quot;&gt;#LI-EJ1 &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0,0&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.everlaw.com/company/mission/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;​​About Everlaw&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Everlaw, you&#39;ll shape how AI re-wires the legal industry, at a category-leading business built on a mission to illuminate the truth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Everlaw is an equal opportunity employer. We pride ourselves on having a diverse workforce and we do not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition, or any other basis protected by law. We respect the gender, gender identity and gender expression of our applicants and employees, and we honor requests for pronouns. It is our policy to comply with all applicable national, state and local laws pertaining to nondiscrimination and equal opportunity, including the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://leginfo.legislature.ca.gov/faces/codes_displaySection.xhtml?lawCode=LAB&amp;amp;sectionNum=1197.5.&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Equal Pay Act&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We collect and process the personal information you provided along with your job application in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.everlaw.com/applicants-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Applicants Privacy Notice and Notice at Collection&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;When preparing to engage with Everlaw as a candidate, you may use AI tools for research, polishing application materials, and interview prep. However, any assessments (unless explicitly stated), remote interviews or live interviews must be completed independently without AI support. &lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to adhere to these rules.&lt;/strong&gt; Here&#39;s the link to our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.everlaw.com/careers/candidate-ai-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;full policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and please reach out with any questions!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We use Gem as part of our hiring and/or promotional processes. As part of the evaluation process, we provide Gem with job requirements and candidate-submitted applications. Certain features of the platform may qualify it as an Automated Employment Decision Tool (AEDT) under applicable regulations. For positions in New York City, our use of Gem complies with NYC Local Law 144. We began using Gem in April 2026.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll craft compelling, narrative-driven content that transforms how the legal industry understands its work, translating complex ideas into clear stories that educate prospects, elevate customers, and expand our organic search reach. You&#39;ll work closely with internal subject matter experts and external champions to uncover powerful legal narratives and convert them into high-performing articles, whitepapers, and convertible marketing assets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time, exempt position based in our Oakland, CA office with a hybrid work schedule: in office M/W/Th with the option to work from home on Tu/Fr.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of Everlaw’s key customer segments, their day-to-day challenges, and the outcomes they care about most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, engaging content across multiple formats and channels, including articles, whitepapers, case studies, and website content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal subject matter experts and external legal partners to identify compelling customer stories and thought leadership opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce strategic content that fuels inbound search traffic and supports outbound lead generation across the buyer’s journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and report on content performance across production, traffic, and lead generation, running regular experiments to optimize results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore innovative B2B marketing channels, trends, and formats as an active, contributing member of the marketing creative think tank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 5 years of content marketing or writing experience (or at least 3+ years with an advanced degree) creating impactful B2B content aligned with strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a strong narrative background in writing or journalism, with a talent for converting complex topics into persuasive, accessible stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a collaborative project manager who can align internal stakeholders, build consensus, and deliver high-quality work on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring curiosity and a test-and-learn mindset to content creation, regularly seeking out new approaches to engage target audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are authorized to work in the United States. Please note that at this time, Everlaw is not sponsoring U.S. employment visas for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Juris Doctor (JD) or direct experience writing for legal, regulatory, or technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think you&#39;re missing some of the skills and are hesitant to apply? We do not believe in the &#39;perfect&#39; candidate and encourage you to apply if you feel you can bring value to our team. We often revisit candidates who may have applied for a different role if something comes up that&#39;s a better fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team — Marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing team shapes how Everlaw shows up in the world and connects the company&#39;s mission with the audiences it serves. Across brand, demand generation, product and customer marketing, content, web, design, communications, and public relations, the team turns complex ideas and customer successes into compelling stories and experiences. This work builds awareness, earns trust, and helps more organizations discover a better way to approach their most consequential legal work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards &amp;amp; Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected salary range for this role is $120,000–$152,000. Final salary depends on factors including the candidate&#39;s experience and skills, and the base pay range is subject to change. This role is also eligible for equity and the benefits below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts for health and dependent care expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Membership to Modern Health to support mental health and wellness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored life and disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive equity grants, so you share in Everlaw&#39;s long-term growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan with company matching of up to 4% of eligible annual compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Everyday Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;17 paid vacation days, 11 federal holidays, and paid sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Four &quot;Everlawlidays&quot; (additional paid company-wide days off) per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allocation for learning &amp;amp; development and relevant professional membership dues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work with regular work-from-home days and flexibility for life&#39;s logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly home internet reimbursement, plus a stipend for your desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each workday, plus snacks and company-wide events in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About Everlaw When a lawsuit or investigation happens, teams must comb through vast amounts of electronic evidence — emails, documents, chats, files — to find what matters. That work is not a side task but the case itself, and where most of the time and money in litigation goes. Everlaw is the litigation and investigation management platform changing that, using AI to turn mountains of messy data into the handful of facts that win or lose a case, compressing weeks of work into hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re the kind of place that&#39;s ranked #1 on G2 in our category and named a Great Place to Work™ by our own team. So if you want a front row seat to an industry in transformation, career-defining work you&#39;ll be proud to tell people about, and real upside at a company in control of its own destiny, we&#39;d love to get to know you.&lt;/p&gt;
