&lt;p&gt;The GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team builds the engine behind an efficient, durable growth organization. Across strategy, planning, analytics, systems, and operations, the team sharpens how Everlaw segments markets, deploys resources, forecasts performance, and supports customer-facing teams. This work turns complex data into clear choices and scalable processes, helping the company grow with greater focus and discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected hourly rate range for this role is $53.37–$67.31. Final salary depends on factors including the candidate&#39;s experience and skills, and the base pay range is subject to change. This role is also eligible for equity and the benefits below.&lt;/p&gt;
