&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;The expected salary range for this role is $140,000–$178,000. Final salary depends on factors including the candidate&#39;s experience and skills, and the base pay range is subject to change. This role is also eligible for equity and the benefits below.&lt;/p&gt;
