&lt;h3&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built for the AI Era:&lt;/strong&gt; Everlaw has been committed to AI-assisted workflows for over a decade with tools like predictive coding and document clustering. We’ve continued this leadership into the generative AI era, with best-in-class features like Deep Dive and Coding Suggestions. We don’t layer AI onto our product - we architect intelligent, trustworthy systems grounded in enduring trust that deliver value to users every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture and Growth at the Forefront:&lt;/strong&gt; With a generous L&amp;amp;D budget, clearly codified values, and a commitment to long-term thinking, integrity and discipline, we create an environment where careers grow with intention and purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Our structured onboarding program ensures you understand our product, customers, and market and quickly integrates you into the team, setting you up to contribute thoughtfully from day one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact That Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Through Everlaw for Good, we offer our technology free or at heavily discounted rates to journalists, nonprofits, and pro bono attorneys to advance equitable access to justice beyond the boundaries of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In your role, you&#39;ll...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Product Strategy, Vision &amp;amp; Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with your team to define and own a multi-year strategy and roadmap aligned with company priorities and customer needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a First-Class AI Product Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide PMs in ensuring our AI feature set is best in class for the dynamically evolving legal AI space. You’ll develop a deep understanding of the market, competitive landscape, and user behavior to inform prioritization decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Product Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and elevate a team of 3–6 product managers, fostering a culture of sharp analytical thinking and product excellence. Drive their success through clear feedback, mentorship and bespoke growth plans, while employing a consistent strategy for long-term career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Product Craft: &lt;/strong&gt;Model disciplined, critical use of AI across the full product development lifecycle, and develop AI-augmented ways of working with clear norms around when and how to soundly incorporate AI-generated output into the final work product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and Drive Team Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow the team through intentional hiring and operational refinement, while setting clear expectations and upholding our values and behavioral standards. Drive high performance and accountability, connecting work to the company vision and ensuring every PM is empowered to deliver measurable impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cross-Functional Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the design team to ensure user experience is a first-class citizen. Shepherd product development and enable go-to-market teams so they&#39;re armed to tell the right story and support customers with confidence. Identify R&amp;amp;D-wide process gaps and lead execution of improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model People Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, motivate and influence others across your team and the business. You’ll serve as a senior PM stakeholder in leadership forums, business reviews, and executive presentations. You will drive cross-functional collaboration, and foster an inclusive environment where diverse perspectives are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 7 years of product management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3 years of experience managing teams of product managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of defining product strategy and connecting it to measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to leverage data to uncover underlying business drivers and translate raw insights into strategic, timely product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping products at scale in a fast-paced environment for sophisticated users and complex workflows (enterprise, B2B SaaS, data-heavy, or regulated domains)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or managing ML or LLM-powered products, with a nuanced view of where AI genuinely compounds value for customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent people and project management skills; process-driven with the ability to communicate complex concepts and drive teams toward a shared vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic leader with a deep obsession for product craft and detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
