&lt;li&gt;Research and implement new automation approaches -&amp;nbsp; including the use of AI -&amp;nbsp; to stay ahead of industry trends and keep our testing infrastructure cutting-edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with developers to interpret code coverage results and identify strategic areas for new test investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor QA Engineers on all topics related to automation, helping them troubleshoot technical blockers and uplevel their scripting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
