&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;The Team — Engineering&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;The Engineering team solves problems that are genuinely rare in their scope and scale. Few companies operate on the volume and variety of data Everlaw does, and even fewer must make that data instantly searchable, explainable, secure, and trustworthy enough to stake a legal case on. By balancing technical power with a remarkably intuitive experience, Engineering builds systems that help legal teams find the truth in mountains of evidence faster and with greater confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
